---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About this blog and its author">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Welcome to my corner of the internet. I write about software development,
      web technologies, and whatever else catches my interest.
    </p>
    <p>
      This blog is built with <a href="https://astro.build">Astro</a>, a modern
      static site generator that prioritizes performance and developer experience.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      You can find me on <a href="https://github.com">GitHub</a> or reach out
      via email at <a href="mailto:hello@example.com">hello@example.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
